{"content_hash": "bc471a68208c4e52", "version_id": 183, "article_id": 19, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Arteta Becomes Premier League's Top-Paid Manager", "title_zh": "阿尔特塔成为英超薪水最高的主教练", "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13596325/arsenal-manager-mikel-arteta-becomes-premier-leagues-highest-paid-boss-on-20m-a-year-new-contract-paper-talk", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://e2.365dm.com/26/08/1920x1080/skysports-paper-talk-football_7317647.jpg?20260809160824", "credit": ""}, "published_date": "2026-10-07", "word_count": 237, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Mikel Arteta has signed a new contract with Arsenal, and it makes him the best-paid manager in the Premier League. Meanwhile, other clubs are busy with transfers and new jobs.", "lead_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔跟阿森纳签了新合同，这让他成了英超收入最高的主教练。与此同时，其他俱乐部也在忙着转会和新工作。", "preview": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the highest-paid boss in the Premier League, according to the Daily Mail. He signed a new contract t", "preview_zh": "据《每日邮报》报道，阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔已经成为英超收入最高的主教练。他签了一份新合同，年薪大约2000万英镑。虽然阿森纳最近没有拿到联赛冠军，但俱乐部仍然相信他是合适的人选。因为这份新合同，他现在比英格兰其他任何主教练挣得都多。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 172, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@17fa5ff/content/audio/19/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 87.037, "size_bytes": 525888, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 270, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@17fa5ff/content/data/versions/183.json", "paragraphs": ["Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the highest-paid boss in the Premier League, according to the Daily Mail. He signed a new contract that pays him about £20 million a year. Although Arsenal have not won the league title recently, the club still believes he is the right man for the job. Because of this new deal, he now earns more than any other manager in England.", "Liverpool are thinking about another big signing, reports the Daily Star. The club already has an expensive attacking line-up, but they want to make it even stronger. If they complete this deal, their attack will be one of the most costly in world football. However, no agreement has been reached yet, so fans must wait for more news.", "In other news, Kieran McKenna has found a new job just months after he left Ipswich. He will work as a technical observer for UEFA, according to The Sun. Also, former Premier League player Cheikhou Kouyate said he spent years fighting a heart condition. He kept it a secret during his whole career, and he recently announced his retirement.", "England manager Thomas Tuchel said the \"train is rolling\" even without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp while Palmer was absent, so the coach feels confident about his team. In Scotland, Lawrence Shankland gave an update on his hamstring injury, and Hibs confirmed new members of their coaching staff."], "paragraphs_zh": ["据《每日邮报》报道，阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔已经成为英超收入最高的主教练。他签了一份新合同，年薪大约2000万英镑。虽然阿森纳最近没有拿到联赛冠军，但俱乐部仍然相信他是合适的人选。因为这份新合同，他现在比英格兰其他任何主教练挣得都多。", "据《每日星报》报道，利物浦正在考虑再签一名大牌球员。俱乐部已经有一条很贵的锋线，但他们想让它变得更强。如果他们完成这笔交易，他们的锋线将成为世界足坛最昂贵的锋线之一。不过，目前双方还没有达成协议，所以球迷还得等更多消息。", "另外，基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇几个月后就找到了新工作。据《太阳报》报道，他将为欧足联担任技术观察员。此外，前英超球员谢库·库亚特说，他多年来一直在跟心脏病作斗争。他在整个职业生涯中都对此保密，最近他宣布了退役。", "英格兰队主教练托马斯·图赫尔说，即使没有科尔·帕尔默，“火车也在向前开”。帕尔默缺席期间，英格兰队在欧国联集训中表现出色，所以这位教练对球队很有信心。在苏格兰，劳伦斯·尚克兰更新了自己的腿筋伤势，希伯尼安也确认了教练组的新成员。"], "body": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the highest-paid boss in the Premier League, according to the Daily Mail. He signed a new contract that pays him about £20 million a year. Although Arsenal have not won the league title recently, the club still believes he is the right man for the job. Because of this new deal, he now earns more than any other manager in England.\n\nLiverpool are thinking about another big signing, reports the Daily Star. The club already has an expensive attacking line-up, but they want to make it even stronger. If they complete this deal, their attack will be one of the most costly in world football. However, no agreement has been reached yet, so fans must wait for more news.\n\nIn other news, Kieran McKenna has found a new job just months after he left Ipswich. He will work as a technical observer for UEFA, according to The Sun. Also, former Premier League player Cheikhou Kouyate said he spent years fighting a heart condition. He kept it a secret during his whole career, and he recently announced his retirement.\n\nEngland manager Thomas Tuchel said the \"train is rolling\" even without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp while Palmer was absent, so the coach feels confident about his team. In Scotland, Lawrence Shankland gave an update on his hamstring injury, and Hibs confirmed new members of their coaching staff.", "body_zh": "据《每日邮报》报道，阿森纳主教练米克尔·阿尔特塔已经成为英超收入最高的主教练。他签了一份新合同，年薪大约2000万英镑。虽然阿森纳最近没有拿到联赛冠军，但俱乐部仍然相信他是合适的人选。因为这份新合同，他现在比英格兰其他任何主教练挣得都多。\n\n据《每日星报》报道，利物浦正在考虑再签一名大牌球员。俱乐部已经有一条很贵的锋线，但他们想让它变得更强。如果他们完成这笔交易，他们的锋线将成为世界足坛最昂贵的锋线之一。不过，目前双方还没有达成协议，所以球迷还得等更多消息。\n\n另外，基兰·麦肯纳在离开伊普斯维奇几个月后就找到了新工作。据《太阳报》报道，他将为欧足联担任技术观察员。此外，前英超球员谢库·库亚特说，他多年来一直在跟心脏病作斗争。他在整个职业生涯中都对此保密，最近他宣布了退役。\n\n英格兰队主教练托马斯·图赫尔说，即使没有科尔·帕尔默，“火车也在向前开”。帕尔默缺席期间，英格兰队在欧国联集训中表现出色，所以这位教练对球队很有信心。在苏格兰，劳伦斯·尚克兰更新了自己的腿筋伤势，希伯尼安也确认了教练组的新成员。", "text": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta has become the highest-paid boss in the Premier League, according to the Daily Mail. He signed a new contract that pays him about £20 million a year. Although Arsenal have not won the league title recently, the club still believes he is the right man for the job. Because of this new deal, he now earns more than any other manager in England. Liverpool are thinking about another big signing, reports the Daily Star. The club already has an expensive attacking line-up, but they want to make it even stronger. If they complete this deal, their attack will be one of the most costly in world football. However, no agreement has been reached yet, so fans must wait for more news. In other news, Kieran McKenna has found a new job just months after he left Ipswich. He will work as a technical observer for UEFA, according to The Sun. Also, former Premier League player Cheikhou Kouyate said he spent years fighting a heart condition. He kept it a secret during his whole career, and he recently announced his retirement. England manager Thomas Tuchel said the \"train is rolling\" even without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League camp while Palmer was absent, so the coach feels confident about his team. In Scotland, Lawrence Shankland gave an update on his hamstring injury, and Hibs confirmed new members of their coaching staff.", "vocab": [{"word": "contract", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合同", "note": "常与 sign a contract（签合同）搭配"}, {"word": "highest-paid", "pos": "adj", "zh": "收入最高的", "note": "由最高级加过去分词构成"}, {"word": "manager", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主教练；经理", "note": "英式英语中常指足球队主教练"}, {"word": "signing", "pos": "noun", "zh": "签约；新签的球员", "note": "既可指签约行为，也可指被签下的人"}, {"word": "attacking line-up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "锋线阵容", "note": "line-up 指出场阵容"}, {"word": "absent", "pos": "adj", "zh": "缺席的", "note": "be absent from 表示缺席某活动"}, {"word": "retirement", "pos": "noun", "zh": "退役；退休", "note": "动词是 retire"}, {"word": "heart condition", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "心脏病", "note": "condition 在这里指疾病"}, {"word": "injury", "pos": "noun", "zh": "伤病", "note": "常见搭配 hamstring injury（腿筋伤）"}, {"word": "coaching staff", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "教练组", "note": "staff 是集合名词"}], "title_original": "Papers: Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year", "summary_original": "The top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...", "body_original": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year new contract - Paper Talk\nPlus: Liverpool weigh up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money a